cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "MVTec Visual Inspector: one-class industrial defect detection and localization under a pre-registered protocol"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "thanh"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ThanhDatVN/MVTec-Visual-Inspector"
keywords:
  - anomaly detection
  - industrial inspection
  - one-class learning
  - PatchCore
  - DINOv3
  - MVTec AD 2
  - VisA
abstract: >-
  Defect detection and localization learned from normal images only, evaluated under a protocol
  fixed before the results on VisA, MPDD and MVTec AD 2. The final system fuses a tiled DINOv3
  ViT-H+ nearest-neighbour model with PatchCore (WRN50, 1280 px), thresholds the fused map with
  one global mask rule, and uses a per-category logistic head trained on synthetic defects for
  the continuous maps. On MVTec AD 2's held-out splits (MVTec's server) it scores AU-PRO@0.05
  62.97 / 60.73 and SegF1 53.76 / 51.67.
